flowchart LR
  CODE[Source + lockfile] --> UNIT[Local/CI unit tests]
  UNIT --> COMPOSE[Compose: Postgres + Redis]
  COMPOSE --> INT[Integration + migrations + invariants]
  INT --> IMG[Build multi-stage image]
  IMG --> SCAN[Scan image + SBOM]
  SCAN --> KIND[Load image into kind]
  KIND --> MANIFEST[Apply test-only Kustomize manifests]
  MANIFEST --> SMOKE[Probes + rollout + API smoke tests]
  SMOKE --> CLEAN[Delete cluster and test volumes]
  CLEAN --> REPORT[Retain safe test report tied to commit digest]
